  (text "Phone = USB host. J1 plugs into the phone; CC has Rd (5.1k) so the phone supplies VBUS and enumerates us as a device." (at 25 22 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid a14e13ab-fd33-5240-b8dc-aeefdf08e6d5))
  (text "RP2040 firmware (TinyUSB) = composite device: UAC headset (16 kHz mono in/out) + vendor bulk data interface for the Pocket app." (at 25 28 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5c33b754-0e9f-579f-b207-fe1db2955a7b))
